OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of tenants face care
OL,4,Aalarm price hike
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council acknowledged the increase
OL,7,Fcould put financial pressure on some
OL,8,Fpeople but said the current service
OL,9,Fcharge was not sufficient to cover the
OL,10,Fcost of providing the service.
